(6422172, 952826, 41864, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over sharpened at the top of the stem. Really like the background. Nice dof.</td>', 'Looks a little over sharpened at the top of the stem. Really like the background. Nice dof.', '2011-05-23 08:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422176, 952954, 41864, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, love the pose and the composition. DOF is great.</td>', 'This is a great shot, love the pose and the composition. DOF is great.', '2011-05-23 08:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422179, 952835, 41864, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, not sure if it meets the challenge?? Think perhaps I would crop a bit of the sky. Still love it!</td>', 'Love this shot, not sure if it meets the challenge?? Think perhaps I would crop a bit of the sky. Still love it!', '2011-05-23 08:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422184, 952690, 41864, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. Very pretty. The ladybird looks a little artificial..perhaps a little over processed.</td>', 'Looks like a painting. Very pretty. The ladybird looks a little artificial..perhaps a little over processed.', '2011-05-23 09:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422187, 952846, 41864, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Sharpness is great. Bottom left a little distracting. Very cool :)</td>', 'Great capture. Sharpness is great. Bottom left a little distracting. Very cool :)', '2011-05-23 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422190, 952960, 41864, '<td valign="top">WOW! That is a great pose!! Fantastic shot and the droplet just tops it.</td>', 'WOW! That is a great pose!! Fantastic shot and the droplet just tops it.', '2011-05-23 09:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422216, 952841, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors from the reflected light... The shot is slightly tilted and the knife doesn''t really add interest. It is just out of place. The symmetry has been lost with the placement of the outer glasses. I do love how the knife has a wild gradient formed on it though! You did manage to get some nice light on the stem of the wine goblet.</td>', 'Interesting colors from the reflected light... The shot is slightly tilted and the knife doesn''t really add interest. It is just out of place. The symmetry has been lost with the placement of the outer glasses. I do love how the knife has a wild gradient formed on it though! You did manage to get some nice light on the stem of the wine goblet.', '2011-05-23 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422219, 952911, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of vignette to create the focus point. It may be slightly overdone... I think the sand needs a bit more detail to bring out the texture some. Overall though a good solid shot and good use of white on white.</td>', 'Very nice use of vignette to create the focus point. It may be slightly overdone... I think the sand needs a bit more detail to bring out the texture some. Overall though a good solid shot and good use of white on white.', '2011-05-23 09:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422222, 952960, 11854, '<td valign="top">OMG! This is amazing! Awesome work!</td>', 'OMG! This is amazing! Awesome work!', '2011-05-23 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422224, 952928, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great find and awesome interpretation. The shot itself is lacking depth due to it actually being two dimensional. A little better lighting could help spruce this up a touch.</td>', 'Great find and awesome interpretation. The shot itself is lacking depth due to it actually being two dimensional. A little better lighting could help spruce this up a touch.', '2011-05-23 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422226, 952954, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looks camouflaged! Excellent DoF and very sharp and detailed.</td>', 'Looks camouflaged! Excellent DoF and very sharp and detailed.', '2011-05-23 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422227, 952960, 10785, '<td valign="top">Superb! The frog is reflecting the light which helps match it the background.</td>', 'Superb! The frog is reflecting the light which helps match it the background.', '2011-05-23 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422230, 952938, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute subject. I am not really a fan of the processing though... I know in my mind that the photo is yellow on green and the color overlay does not really change that.</td>', 'It''s a cute subject. I am not really a fan of the processing though... I know in my mind that the photo is yellow on green and the color overlay does not really change that.', '2011-05-23 09:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422235, 952690, 10785, '<td valign="top">The contrast and saturation of the red color give this a more sultry, seductive look. It did however serve to make the ladybug look glassy and sort of unnatural. Still gets high marks in my book.</td>', 'The contrast and saturation of the red color give this a more sultry, seductive look. It did however serve to make the ladybug look glassy and sort of unnatural. Still gets high marks in my book.', '2011-05-23 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422237, 952499, 10785, '<td valign="top">This needed a more central composition. The avocado is too high in the frame for my liking. My eye rests on the entry point of the avocado in the water where the big part of the splash is.</td>', 'This needed a more central composition. The avocado is too high in the frame for my liking. My eye rests on the entry point of the avocado in the water where the big part of the splash is.', '2011-05-23 09:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422238, 952826, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good composition. It''s a little bit dark and I would like to see a little more shutter used to allow some more light in.</td>', 'Good composition. It''s a little bit dark and I would like to see a little more shutter used to allow some more light in.', '2011-05-23 09:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422245, 952941, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot and I like the still life idea. You got great colors and it has a very old style or vintage feel. The shot taken from above is ok except for two things. First the composition. It is off center and not really in the third of the frame. I would have gone square crop on this one. Second is the light. The brightest part of the light misses the center of the subject. It is too the right of the subject. which moves the focal point of the shot off of the subject.</td>', 'This is a good shot and I like the still life idea. You got great colors and it has a very old style or vintage feel. The shot taken from above is ok except for two things. First the composition. It is off center and not really in the third of the frame. I would have gone square crop on this one. Second is the light. The brightest part of the light misses the center of the subject. It is too the right of the subject. which moves the focal point of the shot off of the subject.', '2011-05-23 10:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422249, 952861, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharp detail. Perhaps a little over sharpened, but that is a matter of personal taste. Lovely color and a natural color on color composition. One improvement might be done with the composition. Put the stamen and pistol in the bottom right third of the shot because it appears to be looking up into the sun.</td>', 'Excellent sharp detail. Perhaps a little over sharpened, but that is a matter of personal taste. Lovely color and a natural color on color composition. One improvement might be done with the composition. Put the stamen and pistol in the bottom right third of the shot because it appears to be looking up into the sun.', '2011-05-23 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422255, 951964, 124346, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  What amazing eyes.  This is a winner.</td>', 'Beautiful.  What amazing eyes.  This is a winner.', '2011-05-23 10:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6422256, 952499, 124346, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks so fresh, splashy, fun.  Keep doing other pictures like this, maybe with oranges or lemons.  Good one.</td>', 'Wow, looks so fresh, splashy, fun.  Keep doing other pictures like this, maybe with oranges or lemons.  Good one.', '2011-05-23 10:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
