(6423393, 952505, 124815, '<td valign="top">Dramatic image, fitting title, splendid use of brownish hues, great lesson of life.</td>', 'Dramatic image, fitting title, splendid use of brownish hues, great lesson of life.', '2011-05-24 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423406, 952958, 124815, '<td valign="top">Even without the title, one feels the erosion of time and the glimmers of hope.<br/>I like this image a lot but it remains a bit decorative which is not at all a demeaning remark. I could see it used as a pattern for tiles and its random positioning in relation to each other would create a spectacular geometric effect.</td>', 'Even without the title, one feels the erosion of time and the glimmers of hope.I like this image a lot but it remains a bit decorative which is not at all a demeaning remark. I could see it used as a pattern for tiles and its random positioning in relation to each other would create a spectacular geometric effect.', '2011-05-24 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423407, 952954, 124815, '<td valign="top">Unexpected encounter with a good conversationalist! Absolutely adorable in its shy pinkish hue.</td>', 'Unexpected encounter with a good conversationalist! Absolutely adorable in its shy pinkish hue.', '2011-05-24 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423408, 952928, 124815, '<td valign="top">One of these haphazard encounters with the alter ego, on a rainy, bad hair day. The grey hue does not win me over completely. Perhaps with more contrast or less saturation. It''s just a touch undecided.</td>', 'One of these haphazard encounters with the alter ego, on a rainy, bad hair day. The grey hue does not win me over completely. Perhaps with more contrast or less saturation. It''s just a touch undecided.', '2011-05-24 13:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423413, 952499, 124815, '<td valign="top">This tops  most of the water/droplets/crisp light images that I saw here so far because it goes way beyond just amazing us technically. <br/>There is a story that transcends the effect and one can look and find interest in what the image says forgetting that there is an avocado and some water trick but getting a lot of thoughts and feelings ranging from the imminent danger of an eruption to the peaceful contemplation of a new specie of mushroom. Or snail.</td>', 'This tops  most of the water/droplets/crisp light images that I saw here so far because it goes way beyond just amazing us technically. There is a story that transcends the effect and one can look and find interest in what the image says forgetting that there is an avocado and some water trick but getting a lot of thoughts and feelings ranging from the imminent danger of an eruption to the peaceful contemplation of a new specie of mushroom. Or snail.', '2011-05-24 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
