(6423531, 952960, 132996, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!!!! I love the use of color!!! :D</td>', 'Amazing capture!!!! I love the use of color!!! :D', '2011-05-24 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423532, 952878, 132996, '<td valign="top">Aww that''s cute! They have such a personality! Great shot. :)</td>', 'Aww that''s cute! They have such a personality! Great shot. :)', '2011-05-24 16:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423542, 952793, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors of the plants at the front of the image. I think the composition is way off. You could''ve gone for mountains to the side, or maybe show more of the bright plants. Right at the center, there are some plants poking out from underneath making the image odd. Also, your horizon is tilted. better luck next time!</td>', 'I like the bright colors of the plants at the front of the image. I think the composition is way off. You could''ve gone for mountains to the side, or maybe show more of the bright plants. Right at the center, there are some plants poking out from underneath making the image odd. Also, your horizon is tilted. better luck next time!', '2011-05-24 16:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423544, 952925, 58634, '<td valign="top">Superb image, but I would''ve liked a not so tilted angle better, I think.</td>', 'Superb image, but I would''ve liked a not so tilted angle better, I think.', '2011-05-24 16:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423545, 952936, 58634, '<td valign="top">Bright, colorful, vivid and beautiful. I would''ve liked for the petals on the top flower to be in foucs, though. -7</td>', 'Bright, colorful, vivid and beautiful. I would''ve liked for the petals on the top flower to be in foucs, though. -7', '2011-05-24 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423546, 952808, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and contrasts. I love squirrels, they''re so cute :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and contrasts. I love squirrels, they''re so cute :)', '2011-05-24 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423548, 951927, 58634, '<td valign="top">Interesting sense of motion.</td>', 'Interesting sense of motion.', '2011-05-24 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423619, 952897, 58634, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors. I like the round shadow/light produced in this image, but I''m still trying to figure out what this is?</td>', 'Vibrant colors. I like the round shadow/light produced in this image, but I''m still trying to figure out what this is?', '2011-05-24 19:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423620, 952911, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great subject. It seems like the shadows and highlights are pretty harsh in this image, though.</td>', 'Great subject. It seems like the shadows and highlights are pretty harsh in this image, though.', '2011-05-24 19:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423621, 952939, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of composition. I think most would''ve gone for the fawn on the bottom right hand corner, but you made it work. <br/>Was this colorized in some way? Maybe it''s my vision, but I think I''m seeing random patches of green throughout the image?</td>', 'I like your choice of composition. I think most would''ve gone for the fawn on the bottom right hand corner, but you made it work. Was this colorized in some way? Maybe it''s my vision, but I think I''m seeing random patches of green throughout the image?', '2011-05-24 19:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423623, 952937, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the hues in this image. I also enjoy the slight depth of field that makes the plant stand out more. Some areas look a bit overexposed, and noisy but it doesn''t take too much away from the photograph.</td>', 'I like the hues in this image. I also enjoy the slight depth of field that makes the plant stand out more. Some areas look a bit overexposed, and noisy but it doesn''t take too much away from the photograph.', '2011-05-24 19:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423624, 952505, 58634, '<td valign="top">Such a minute little creature! I like that the smallness of it is put into perspective by only having it occupy a small area of the frame.</td>', 'Such a minute little creature! I like that the smallness of it is put into perspective by only having it occupy a small area of the frame.', '2011-05-24 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423625, 952915, 58634, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the nice, crisp, textured focus quite a bit.</td>', 'I enjoy the nice, crisp, textured focus quite a bit.', '2011-05-24 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6423626, 952841, 58634, '<td valign="top">Whoah, the colors are so trippy!</td>', 'Whoah, the colors are so trippy!', '2011-05-24 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
