(6427831, 952960, 59267, '<td valign="top">Hey, I didn''t know we can browse photos this way, I learned now. Thank you for the links!!<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FocusPoint:</b></div><hr/><i> BTW, you have broke <strike>two</strike> three records,<br/> <br/>one for the camera, one for the lens <i>and <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">one for yourself</a></i> :)<br/> <br/>Camera: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/camera.php?CAMERA_ID=1917" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Canon EOS-7D</a> <br/>Lens: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/lens.php?LENS_ID=1137" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Canon EF-S 60mm f/2.8 Macro USM</a> </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Hey, I didn''t know we can browse photos this way, I learned now. Thank you for the links!!Originally posted by FocusPoint: BTW, you have broke two three records, one for the camera, one for the lens and one for yourself :) Camera: Canon EOS-7D Lens: Canon EF-S 60mm f/2.8 Macro USM ', '2011-05-30 01:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
