(6427947, 952960, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ammie:</b></div><hr/><i> I should have known this is yours. Still awesome and congrats on your achievement. I echo Littlemav. Your pictures are inspiring. Please keep it up and don''t EVER quit DPC </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You are smart! that''s what I planned to. Now this frog saved me at least 3 more months.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ammie: I should have known this is yours. Still awesome and congrats on your achievement. I echo Littlemav. Your pictures are inspiring. Please keep it up and don''t EVER quit DPC  You are smart! that''s what I planned to. Now this frog saved me at least 3 more months.', '2011-05-30 02:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
