(6428418, 952846, 129706, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by one2one:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture here. My only 10 vote. I see the 1,2,3 trolls were out again for this water drop. <br/> <br/>Did you add anything to your water like rinse-aid for dishwashers? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, I put (water + goma guar) in the dropper and (water + 2 or 3 drops of rinse aid) in the vase or plate where the drop splash.<br/>Please, do not hesitate to ask for so many explanations me since you wish.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by one2one: Great capture here. My only 10 vote. I see the 1,2,3 trolls were out again for this water drop.  Did you add anything to your water like rinse-aid for dishwashers?   Yes, I put (water + goma guar) in the dropper and (water + 2 or 3 drops of rinse aid) in the vase or plate where the drop splash.Please, do not hesitate to ask for so many explanations me since you wish. ', '2011-05-30 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 0),
